      "portrait_expression": "sacred_quiet",
      "setting_description": "The Covenant of Presence",
      "prompt": "We never spoke the word. We never needed to. Our love lived in how we were together. In the way he let me teach him that presence matters. In the way I let him show me that structure can be a form of care.",
